 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id1194561\" class=\"interactive\" data-label=\"\">\n<h2 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<h3 data-type=\"title\" class=\"os-subtitle\">\n  <span class=\"os-subtitle-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id1723106\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/796124c7769a1532586e2c2a9655343c1b252519\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-id2215743\">You can watch an excellent animation of the endomembrane system <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fcxc8Gv7NiU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">here</a>. At the end of the animation, there is a short self-assessment.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
